# Arquitetura — Zofia Code Labs App

Fluxo: **UI → Server Action → Use Case → Repository / Service**.

## Stack

| Aspecto | Tecnologia |
|---------|------------|
| Framework | Next.js 16 (App Router), React 19 |
| DB | PostgreSQL + Prisma 7 (`src/generated/prisma`) |
| Auth | NextAuth v5 (`src/auth.ts`, `lib/auth/`) |
| UI | Tailwind 4, Radix/shadcn (`src/components/ui`) |
| Forms | React Hook Form + Zod (`src/schemas/`) |
| i18n | next-intl — `pt` (default), `en` — `messages/{locale}.json` |

## Pastas principais

```
src/
├── app/[locale]/(public|private)/...
│   └── clients/.../projects/[slug]/[parentTab]/@overview|@backlog|...
├── actions/<domínio>/*Action.ts
├── useCases/<domínio>/*UseCase.ts + factories/make*UseCase.ts
├── repositories/I*.ts + prisma/Prisma*.ts + in-memory/InMemory*.ts
├── services/          # GitHub, Sonar, Umami, R2, Documenso, …
├── lib/               # auth, prisma, operationWrapper, mailer, logger
├── components/ + schemas/ + mappers/ + errors/ + @types/
└── generated/prisma/  # não editar
```

**Controllers = Server Actions** → factories `make*UseCase`.

## Camadas

| Camada | Responsabilidade |
|--------|------------------|
| Pages / `_components/` | RSC; `page.tsx` async, sem `'use client'` |
| `_data/get-cached-*.ts` | `cache()` + `operationWrapper` → action |
| Server Actions | `auth()`, Zod, use case, revalidate, `{ success, message }` |
| Use Cases | Regras, `checkUserPermissionForAsset`, services |
| Repositories | Prisma; contratos e DTOs em `I*.ts` |
| Services | HTTP/SDKs externos |

## operationWrapper (`src/lib/operationWrapper.ts`)

Usar em **Server Components** para chamar actions/repositories com tracing e tratamento uniforme:

```typescript
const [error, data] = await operationWrapper(
  "action",
  "fetchClientsAction",
  () => fetchClientsAction(query),
  { cache: "no-cache" },
);
const list = error ? [] : data.clients;
```

Retorno: tupla `[error, success]`. Opções: `cache`, `tags`, `revalidatePaths`. Tipos em `src/@types/OperationWrapperTypes`.

## Server Action (padrão)

```typescript
"use server";
import { auth } from "@/auth";
import { resolveActionErrorMessage, resolveSuccessMessage, serverErrorMessage } from "@/errors/resolveActionErrorMessage";
import { makeCreateXUseCase } from "@/useCases/x/factories/makeCreateXUseCase";
import { xFormSchema } from "@/schemas/x/xFormSchema";
import { revalidatePath } from "next/cache";

export async function createXAction(formData: FormData) {
  const session = await auth();
  if (!session?.user) return { success: false, message: await serverErrorMessage("unauthorized") };
  try {
    const validated = xFormSchema.parse({ /* FormData */ });
    await makeCreateXUseCase().execute(
      { ...validated, organizationId: session.user.organizationId },
      session.user.id,
    );
    revalidatePath("/caminho");
    return { success: true, message: await resolveSuccessMessage("xCreated") };
  } catch (error) {
    return { success: false, message: await resolveActionErrorMessage(error) };
  }
}
```

Novas actions: sufixo `Action`. Legado sem sufixo existe — não replicar.

## Erros

- Domínio: `AppError` e subclasses — não `throw new Error()` em regra de negócio
- Actions: `resolveActionErrorMessage` — sem stack para o cliente
- i18n de erro: `legacyErrorMap`, `resolveErrorMessage`

## RBAC

- `src/constants/permissions.ts` — `PERMISSIONS`, `PERMISSIONS_MAP`
- Rotas: `src/proxy.ts` + `routePermissionMap.ts`
- Recursos: `checkUserPermissionForAsset` → `lib/auth/strategies/`
- Portal: `TENANT_OBSERVER`, `ClientEmployees`, `clientPortalRouteMap`
- UI: `hasPermission(session?.user, PERMISSIONS.*)`

Nova feature: permissão + strategy (se recurso novo) + `routePermissionMap` + `messages/pt.json` e `en.json`.

## Tipagem

- Zod: `src/schemas/<domínio>/` → `z.infer`
- DTOs: `repositories/I*.ts` (`ICreate*DTO`, …)
- Prisma: `@/generated/prisma`
- Auxiliares: `src/@types/` (`DocumentInput`, `PrismaToPlain`)
- Apresentação: `src/mappers/`

## Middleware (`src/proxy.ts`)

Locale, auth, `canAccessRoute`, APIs (Bearer, webhook Documenso).

## Banco

- `prisma.config.ts`, migrations em `prisma/migrations/`
- Seeds: `prisma/seeds/` (01–09)
- Após schema: `npx prisma generate`

## Domínios (rotas)

Dashboard, `/clients`, projetos (parallel routes), `/financial`, `/settings/*`, `/organization/*`, portal `/minhas-empresas`, `/purchase/*`.

Schemas PG: `identity`, `catalog`, `crm`, `projects`, `financial`, `integrations`, `audit`.

## Integrações

R2 (`services/s3Client/`), Documenso (responsável legal no `Client`), GitHub/Sonar/Umami, `OrganizationIntegration`.

## Nomenclatura

| Artefato | Convenção |
|----------|-----------|
| Pastas | kebab-case |
| Componentes | PascalCase |
| Actions / Use cases | `*Action.ts`, `*UseCase.ts` |
| Factories | `make*UseCase.ts`, `make*Repository.ts` |
| Testes | `*.spec.ts` co-located |
